 {
  "id": "telnet_iac_escape",
  "proto": "telnet",
  "summary": "T-TELNET-10: IAC 转义 data 0xFF 翻倍（RFC 854 §3；data_b64 形态）",
  "spec_json": {
   "layers": [
    {
     "ip": {
      "src": "10.0.0.1",
      "dst": "20.0.0.1"
     }
    },
    {
     "telnet": {
      "src_port": 12345,
      "dst_port": 23,
      "dialog": [
       {
        "type": "data",
        "direction": "up",
        "data_b64": "Yf8gYg=="
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "expect": {
   "min_packets": 8,
   "fields": [
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "field": "tcp.flags",
     "value": "0x002"
    },
    {
     "packet": 2,
     "field": "tcp.flags",
     "value": "0x012"
    },
    {
     "packet": 3,
     "field": "tcp.flags",
     "value": "0x010"
    }
   ],
   "frames": [
    {
     "packet": 4,
     "offset": 54,
     "hex": "61ffff2062"
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    "base64 'Yf8gYg=='=a\\xff b → escapeIAC 翻倍 61 ff ff 20 62；JSON data 字段无法表达单字节 0xFF（UTF-8 重编码 C3 BF 陷阱）→ data_b64 形态覆盖（9.22 承载位置扫描）"
   ]
  }
 },
